# TradeTally - .dockerignore

# Node modules
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts
**/build
**/dist
release-assets/

# Docker compose files
**/docker-compose.*.yaml

# Documentation
**/documentation
**/*.md

# IDE and editor configs
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.agents

# Git
.git/
.github/

# Logs and coverage
**/logs
**/coverage

# Misc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
# Public trust anchor; not private key material.
!backend/src/certs/apple-root-ca-g3.pem
**/*.key

# Temporary files
**/*.tmp
**/*.log

# Docker ignore for Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
